---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Alexa | Dodo & Co." description="Meet Alexa Gisch, labor and delivery nurse, certified pediatric sleep consultant and mama behind Dodo & Co." current="about">

  <div class="hero"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Alexa</span>
      <h1>Hi, I'm Alexa. <em>Nurse, mama</em>, and the heart behind Dodo &amp; Co.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I'm a labor and delivery nurse with a master's in nursing and a background in developmental psychology, and a certified pediatric sleep consultant. Most of all, I'm a mom who knows how hard those sleepless months can be.</p>
      <div class="ctas"><a class="btn primary" href="/get-started">Book your free intro call</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="arch"><div class="frame"><img src="/img/alexa-smile.jpg" alt="Alexa smiling with her toddler on the beach" style="object-position:58% center"></div><span class="star" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
  </div></div>

  <section><div class="wrap split">
    <div class="photostack"><div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:3/4"><img src="/img/alexa-bump.jpg" alt="Alexa pregnant, walking on the beach" loading="lazy"></div><div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:3/4"><img src="/img/family-boat.jpg" alt="Alexa, her husband and their baby on a boat" loading="lazy"></div></div>
    <div class="txt">
      <span class="eyebrow">My story</span>
      <h2>Better sleep helped me feel like me again.</h2>
      <p>Like so many new moms, I found myself navigating sleep deprivation, endless Google searches and moments of self-doubt. Postpartum felt dark and isolating, and somewhere along the way I lost a little piece of myself.</p>
      <p>When our daughter was about 4 months old, we sleep trained, and it changed so much more than our nights. Learning about infant sleep and finding a consistent routine helped our whole family. I hoped for a happier, well-rested baby. What I gained was a passion for helping other parents feel that same peace, confidence and connection.</p>
      <p class="pull">“Every baby is unique, every family is different, and there is no one-size-fits-all approach to sleep.”</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap split rev">
    <div class="txt">
      <span class="eyebrow">The name</span>
      <h2>Faire dodo, and the “Co.”</h2>
      <p><i>Faire dodo</i> is French for “to go night-night.” The name brings together two things close to my heart: working with moms and babies, and my love of French culture from my French minor.</p>
      <p>It's also a tribute to my wonderful European mama, who has a PhD in child development and is a sleep consultant herself. I grew up close to this work.</p>
      <p>And the “Co.”? That's you. The little dreamers and families I work with, because without them, Dodo would be nothing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:4/5"><img src="/img/alexa-portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of Alexa at the beach" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div></section>

  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Training &amp; experience</span><h2>A warm friend, backed by clinical knowledge.</h2></div>
    <div class="creds">
      <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><p><b>Labor and delivery nurse</b><span>Caring for moms and newborns every week</span></p></div>
      <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><p><b>Master's degree in nursing</b><span>Registered nurse, MSN</span></p></div>
      <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><p><b>Certified pediatric sleep consultant</b><span>Institute of Pediatric Sleep and Parenting, with a newborn emphasis</span></p></div>
      <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><p><b>Background in developmental psychology</b><span>So your plan fits your baby's temperament</span></p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">What I believe</span><h2>Three things I tell every family.</h2></div>
    <div class="beliefs">
      <div class="belief"><h3>Family knows best</h3><p>Trust your gut if something feels off. A plan should never be so rigid that you lose yourself in it.</p></div>
      <div class="belief"><h3>Sleep is essential</h3><p>Babies need sleep to grow and develop, and so do parents. Wanting rest is a necessity of life.</p></div>
      <div class="belief"><h3>Sleep training is a gift</h3><p>Built on secure attachment, it teaches your baby that the crib is a safe space and that you'll always come back.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta"><div><h2>I'd love to meet your family.</h2><p>Bienvenue chez Dodo &amp; Co. Let's make some room for rest, together.</p></div><div class="ctas"><a class="btn primary" href="/get-started">Book a free intro call</a></div></div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
